{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "df13ffdde4f0233c73b7ad47e9ba10571102c716252f4a90efa5e1d1c6c759e6", "ja": "（昨日のハロウィンパーティー楽しかったな。\nみんなも楽しんでくれたみたいだし……おや？）", "zh": "（昨天的万圣节派对真开心啊。大家好像也都玩得很开心……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "41c1daf2477e87db047eb01e986968cdaa134e4d9c5f82b7e983e66454a1a5fc", "ja": "……ふぅっ、10本目～！　けど、まだまだ！\n食べた分の消化をするには……。", "zh": "……呼，第10趟～！不过，还差得远呢！\n为了消耗掉吃下去的分量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9ca98f3393f482d98f98f37c912c528c9affc051ecf15212334b3e6eb7cf76e3", "ja": "お疲れ様、のり子。\nなんだか10本目って声が聞こえたけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，典子。我好像听到了“第10趟”来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "d2a7c8a2f5133a9f6df35f66b260429848822c1b5d31a1670f982ded46b6c025", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　ちょっと、\n軽いダイエットを兼ねた、走り込みをね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我就是想顺便稍微减个肥，跑跑步来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae23781ad432dd1ac86cf9834e436bc1c7c23b9d1f470b17afea37d527e3facb", "ja": "昨日のパーティー、すっごく楽しかったけど、\n少し食べすぎたかな～……って反省してさ。", "zh": "昨天的派对真的超开心，\n不过好像吃多了一点点呢……所以在反省啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1005_p", "source_sha256": "003a0ffcf856657d4cc12e03f5bf93afb2420024ceb65baaf6216300df695b48", "ja": "ああ……。みんなもそうだけど、\nのり子も、ずいぶんはしゃいでたな。", "zh": "啊……大家都是这样，\n连纪子也玩得特别疯啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "189c827319b4fa830b197da5928047e06d63d87d475cbea28cb74bc2d98388d6", "ja": "み、見てたの、{$P$}！？\nでも仕方ないよ。美味しそうな料理ばっかりでさ！", "zh": "你、你看到了吗，{$P$}！？\n但这也是没办法的嘛。全都是看起来好好吃的料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8a337da381aa9d673b18b1801d66af798ff9e06c2c37e29984e8ecff1d6c9e0b", "ja": "はは、そうだな。けど……\n食べすぎの割には、運動が激しすぎないか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过……\n就算是吃太多了，运动量也未免太大了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "da87153643d63c024ad3818da227ef3ed1240db0910ca9e2d395decd20dbe0bc", "ja": "あはは、実はさ……食べ過ぎたのって、\n昨日だけじゃないんだよね～。", "zh": "啊哈哈，其实啊……吃太多的可不只是昨天哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "42132ceecc9e288dc93305329a477cbed2ae32b7e222efea929974edc26f5af1", "ja": "ほら、秋は美味しいものがたくさんあるでしょ？\nおイモに、フルーツに、お魚に……。", "zh": "你看，秋天有很多好吃的东西吧？\n红薯、水果，还有鱼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "81d7fb9f2e04f9275f6fb1f103e42cab63ef1a8488e0df367805987440cb434c", "ja": "油断したら、すぐ衣装が入らなくなるし……\nダンスの動きも悪くなるから、気が抜けなくて。", "zh": "一不小心，演出服马上就穿不上了……\n舞蹈动作也会变得不灵活，所以一点都不能松懈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1011_p", "source_sha256": "017ec7f295c511470a50fc3ca05cc859be958e2b0e67bb58e82ed9473f3ff4e8", "ja": "確かに。ついつい食べすぎちゃうよな……。", "zh": "确实。不知不觉就吃多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "3834302a3c602319fa4591e2545f7c64f7d3bcb62eea20ff460de1c5124431e1", "ja": "あ、じゃあ{$P$}も一緒に走る？\n秋は食欲だけじゃなくて、運動も楽しい季節だよ！", "zh": "啊，那{$P$}也要一起跑吗？\n秋天不仅是食欲旺盛的季节，也是适合运动的季节哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2fc69a62219f4125d8c60d96b8563bcc9b1b8ad0b23fa26e5d2e758eefa8b547", "ja": "そうだな。たまには体を動かさないとな！\nでも、のり子のペースについていける自信は……。", "zh": "是啊，偶尔也得活动活动身体才行！\n不过……我可没信心跟上德莉子的步调。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "1ed8cddd52085c582125b37c78a8306f787bdfd419b622ffdd5e84e8acbb144e", "ja": "大丈夫、大丈夫。ちゃんとペースは合わせるよ！\nそれにこういうのは、誰かとやるほうが楽しいし。", "zh": "没问题，没问题。我会好好配合你的步调的！\n而且这种事情，还是跟别人一起做比较开心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "dee32d09248391f99da3c2a9ac612092b05b74e2fa8597526ce1f0cce52557fb", "ja": "お喋りでもしながら、のんびり走ろっ！\n景色を見ながら、ふたりで秋を満喫しようよ♪", "zh": "边聊天边慢慢跑吧！\n一边欣赏风景，一边享受我们两个人的秋天吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0553_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7fff00fd5116744328ad2d83560906295e01bfce7aba4dfcf962b380efc54841", "ja": "（その後、休憩時間にのり子と楽しくランニングを\nした。久しぶりにいい運動に……つ、疲れた～！）", "zh": "（之后，休息时间和のり子一起愉快地跑了步。好久没做这么好的运动了……累、累死我了～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
